StarSheets is built on GridCraft (https://github.com/storytold/gridcraft):
Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the GridCraft contributors, MIT OR Apache-2.0.
GridCraft's code is fetched at build time (scripts/fetch-upstream.sh) and is not redistributed
in this repository, except app/src/web.rs and app/src/prefs.rs, which are adapted from
GridCraft's apps/gridcraft-web and say so at the top. GridCraft's own NOTICE and
ATTRIBUTION.md list the third-party material it bundles; built StarSheets sites include it.

Bundled assets: Roboto fonts (app/fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1) and Material Symbols icons
(app/icons, Apache License 2.0); see the README in each folder. The web fonts in the font
menu (app/webfonts.txt) are downloaded from Google Fonts at build time and served with their
licences (all SIL Open Font License 1.1): webfonts/NOTICE.txt and webfonts/<font>/LICENSE.txt in
every built site.

